[00:00.78]Lesson 133 | 第133课
[00:03.58]Sensational news! | 爆炸性新闻!
[00:06.87]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.61]What reasons did Karen Marsh give for wanting to retire? | 卡伦·马什给出了什么退休的理由?
[00:20.87]Have you just made a new film, Miss Marsh? | 马什小姐,您刚拍完一部新电影吗?
[00:25.34]Yes, I have. | 是的,刚拍完。
[00:28.10]Are you going to make another? | 您打算再拍一部吗?
[00:30.85]No, I'm not. | 不,不打算了。
[00:33.16]I'm going to retire. | 我打算退休。
[00:36.17]I feel very tired. | 我感觉很累。
[00:39.16]I don't want to make another film for a long time. | 我不想在短期内再拍电影了。
[00:46.46]Let's buy a newspaper, Liz. | 莉兹,我们买份报纸吧。
[00:50.28]Listen to this! | 听听这条!
[00:52.80]'Karen Marsh: Sensational News! | '卡伦·马什:爆炸性新闻!
[00:57.45]By our reporter, Alan Jones. | 本报记者艾伦·琼斯报道。
[01:02.26]Karen Marsh arrived at London Airport today. | 卡伦·马什今天到达伦敦机场。
[01:07.85]She was wearing a blue dress and a mink coat. | 她穿着一件蓝色连衣裙和一件貂皮大衣。
[01:13.86]She told me she had just made a new film. | 她告诉我她刚拍完一部新电影。
[01:19.70]she said she was not going to make another. | 她说她不打算再拍一部了。
[01:25.90]She said she was going to retire. | 她说她打算退休。
[01:30.50]She told reporters she felt very tired and didn't want to make another film for a long time.' | 她告诉记者她感到很累,不想在短期内再拍电影了。'
[01:42.05]I wonder why! | 我想知道为什么!